<% content_for :title, "Ruby Jam 訂餐助手" %>

<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Ruby Jam 訂餐助手</h1>
<p class="mb-6">每月找餐廳、算人數、產生詢問訊息，15 分鐘內完成。</p>

<section class="rounded-box bg-base-200 p-4 space-y-4" aria-label="色票預覽">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
    <button class="btn btn-primary">主要按鈕</button>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary">候選名單</button>
    <span class="badge badge-accent h-8 px-3">餐＋飲</span>
    <span class="badge badge-warning h-8 px-3">超出預算</span>
  </div>
  <label class="form-control w-full">
    <span class="label-text mb-1 block">輸入框（字級 16px）</span>
    <input type="text" class="input input-bordered w-full" placeholder="搜尋店家">
  </label>
</section>
